blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not traditional choices but I'm going to add: Gangrel who got a really fucked up beast trait, and Tzim with a bondage mermaid fetish.</div> </div> </div> </div>Gangrel Mariners are already a canon part of the game. They're a weird quasi-bloodline that seems to occur in Gangrel that choose aquatic lifestyles. Unlike a full bloodline, childer of Mariners aren't forced to be Mariners themselves. They can chose to live on land an stay normal Gangrel instead.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-15T14:12:12-07:00","id":702516,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/701860-mermaids?p=702497#post702497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Gangrel Mariners are already a canon part of the game. They're a weird quasi-bloodline that seems to occur in Gangrel that choose aquatic lifestyles. Unlike a full bloodline, childer of Mariners aren't forced to be Mariners themselves. They can chose to live on land an stay normal Gangrel instead.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mariners are more Creature from the Black Lagoon than mermaids, though.","signatu